# Security

- Read secrets from the environment. Do not log them.
- Require `X-API-Key` on `/api/v1` routes.
- Allowlist provider hosts before every outbound request.
- Treat provider text as data. Do not copy it into the user-facing narrative.
- Do not add order, wallet, or transfer tools.
- Keep AgentOS disabled in the public Render service.
